    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connected is a casual cooperative puzzle game where two charming robots are \u2014quite literally\u2014 linked by a cable. Together, they must navigate a variety of levels, collecting batteries to keep the power towers running inside a mysterious factory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a unique two-player experience: the robots must stay connected at all times, turning every movement into a challenge of coordination and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/5ac0ad3e268559a3a00aed2b395a0a8a.poster.avif?t=1747870388\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/5ac0ad3e268559a3a00aed2b395a0a8a.webm?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/5ac0ad3e268559a3a00aed2b395a0a8a.mp4?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics is Your Ally</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover creative solutions through the cable\u2019s physics. Its elasticity can be both a challenge and a tool to overcome clever obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/aed49345a999faf73108e6c8aef3170d.poster.avif?t=1747870388\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/aed49345a999faf73108e6c8aef3170d.webm?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/aed49345a999faf73108e6c8aef3170d.mp4?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purposeful Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the connecting cable to move objects, activate mechanisms, and solve puzzles that will test your logic and cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/3218190dcdea8065593c47d84bf39dd2.poster.avif?t=1747870388\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/3218190dcdea8065593c47d84bf39dd2.webm?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/3218190dcdea8065593c47d84bf39dd2.mp4?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress through levels filled with trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from unpredictable traps to enemies ready to sabotage your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/561e0d8e7f93783790ccc3712c55685d.poster.avif?t=1747870388\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/561e0d8e7f93783790ccc3712c55685d.webm?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/561e0d8e7f93783790ccc3712c55685d.mp4?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connected is a casual cooperative puzzle game where two charming robots are \u2014quite literally\u2014 linked by a cable. Together, they must navigate a variety of levels, collecting batteries to keep the power towers running inside a mysterious factory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a unique two-player experience: the robots must stay connected at all times, turning every movement into a challenge of coordination and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/5ac0ad3e268559a3a00aed2b395a0a8a.poster.avif?t=1747870388\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/5ac0ad3e268559a3a00aed2b395a0a8a.webm?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/5ac0ad3e268559a3a00aed2b395a0a8a.mp4?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics is Your Ally</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover creative solutions through the cable\u2019s physics. Its elasticity can be both a challenge and a tool to overcome clever obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/aed49345a999faf73108e6c8aef3170d.poster.avif?t=1747870388\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/aed49345a999faf73108e6c8aef3170d.webm?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/aed49345a999faf73108e6c8aef3170d.mp4?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purposeful Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the connecting cable to move objects, activate mechanisms, and solve puzzles that will test your logic and cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/3218190dcdea8065593c47d84bf39dd2.poster.avif?t=1747870388\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/3218190dcdea8065593c47d84bf39dd2.webm?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/3218190dcdea8065593c47d84bf39dd2.mp4?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress through levels filled with trials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from unpredictable traps to enemies ready to sabotage your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/561e0d8e7f93783790ccc3712c55685d.poster.avif?t=1747870388\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/561e0d8e7f93783790ccc3712c55685d.webm?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678070/extras/561e0d8e7f93783790ccc3712c55685d.mp4?t=1747870388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
